=== Test 6: rejection — CASE condition on CTE aggregate output ===
Expected error: CTE aggregate output in CASE condition not yet supported
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CASE condition referencing a CTE aggregate output is not yet supported; reference a CTE column projection instead, or move the predicate into the CTE body's WHERE clause.


=== Test 7: arithmetic inside CASE arms, parentheses around the CASE ===
== Query ==
SELECT o_custkey, SUM((CASE WHEN o_amt > 50 THEN o_amt * 2 ELSE -o_amt END)) AS s
FROM cte_orders
GROUP BY o_custkey;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
SELECT o_custkey, SUM((CASE WHEN o_amt > 50 THEN o_amt * 2 ELSE -o_amt END)) AS s
FROM cte_orders
GROUP BY o_custkey|
o_custkey	s
100	100
200	80
300	180


=== Test 8: CASE after an aggregate that saves a copy for a later one ===
== Query ==
SELECT o_custkey, SUM(o_amt * 2) AS a, SUM(CASE WHEN o_amt > 45 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS b, SUM(o_amt) AS c
FROM cte_orders
GROUP BY o_custkey;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
SELECT o_custkey, SUM(o_amt * 2) AS a, SUM(CASE WHEN o_amt > 45 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS b, SUM(o_amt) AS c
FROM cte_orders
GROUP BY o_custkey|
o_custkey	a	b	c
100	250	2	125
200	200	1	100
300	180	1	90


=== Test 9: rejection — CASE as an operand of arithmetic ===
Expected error: CASE only as the whole aggregate argument
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CASE is supported only as the whole argument of an aggregate function, as in SUM(CASE WHEN ... THEN ... ELSE ... END). It cannot be used in arithmetic or in a THEN or ELSE of another CASE.


